<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #eef0f6; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #131a31; }
      .container { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff5f5; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; padding: 20px; }
      .headline { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #be123c; }
      .description { color: #4b5563; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .code-box { margin: 16px 0; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; }
      .code-value { margin: 0; font-family: monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #be123c; text-decoration: line-through; }
      .reason { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #7f1d1d; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="headline">Código promocional cancelado</p>
      <p class="description">
        Hola {{recipientName}}, el organizador canceló el código promocional para el evento <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> y ya no podrá ser redimido.
      </p>
      <div class="code-box">
        <p class="code-value">{{promoCode}}</p>
        {{#if discountLabel}}
        <p class="reason">{{discountLabel}}</p>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      {{#if cancelReason}}
      <p class="reason">Motivo: {{cancelReason}}</p>
      {{/if}}
      <p class="description">{{message}}</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
